OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new leisure centre set to
OL,4,Abegin
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a new leisure centre in
OL,7,FBramcote is set to start in a matter of
OL,8,Fweeks, councillors have confirmed.
OL,10,FBroxtowe Borough Council's planning
OL,11,Fcommittee approved designs for a new
OL,12,Fbuilding in January. It will replace
OL,13,Fthe existing leisure centre in Derby
OL,14,FRoad.
OL,16,FDeputy leader of the council, Greg
OL,17,FMarshall, said the existing site will
OL,18,Fbe kept open while the new centre is
OL,19,Fbuilt, adding work will begin "towards
OL,20,Fthe end of September this year [or] the
OL,21,Fbeginning of October".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
